# The repo root holds ~60GB (checkpoints 25G, third_party 17G, data 8.8G, venvs 16G).
# None of it belongs in the build context -- it is bind-mounted at runtime instead.
# Deny everything, then re-allow only what the image actually builds from.
*

!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!src/
!docker/entrypoint.sh
